      "build_group": "extensions/text_hash_extra",
      "profile": "Static C99; no configure downloads; no external services required",
      "source_mutations": "NONE; adapter-only configuration",
      "notes": [
        "Process-global editor environment: serialize through one terminal service, do not clone backend state per actor. Own C API; functional alternative to Readline, not ABI-compatible.",
        "Upstream default debug function retained because IC_NO_DEBUG_MSG uses an empty variadic-macro call rejected by strict C99. Debug output requires ISOCLINE_DEBUG.",
        "The embedded wcwidth code has a permissive Markus Kuhn notice retained in src/wcwidth.c."
      ]
