      "build_group": "extensions/text_hash_extra",
      "profile": "Static C99; no configure downloads; no external services required",
      "source_mutations": "NONE; adapter-only configuration",
      "notes": [
        "XXH_NAMESPACE=LMXC99_XXH_ is PRIVATE to the library. Consumers include lmx_xxhash_modern.h, which sets the same namespace.",
        "Modern and legacy LZ4 xxHash headers must be isolated in separate C translation units. Do not undefine namespace aliases and do not promise mixed-header compatibility.",
        "Only BSD library files are retained; GPL xxhsum CLI and its tests are not included.",
        "Same-process separate-unit comparison with the existing legacy XXH64 backend passes. XXH3 adds a distinct hash algorithm; outputs cannot be substituted for XXH64."
      ],
      "canonical_header_map": {
        "vendor/xxhash/xxhash.h": "lmx_xxhash_modern.h"
      },
      "abi_symbol_prefix_map": {
        "XXH": "LMXC99_XXH_XXH"
      }
